{% comment %}
  Renders the "Transmission Ended" banner for archived Broadcast products.
  This is the visual notice only -- product templates that render it should
  also check the same condition to disable Add to Cart / variant selection,
  per the bible's "disable purchasing, keep the page visible" rule.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object (required)

  Renders when product.tags contains 'transmission-ended'.

  Usage:
  {% render 'archive-banner', product: product %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- if product.tags contains 'transmission-ended' -%}
  <div class="archive-banner">
    <span class="archive-banner__label font-eyebrow">Transmission Ended</span>
    <p class="archive-banner__text">
      This Broadcast has ended and is no longer available for purchase. {{ product.title }} remains here in the Static
      Archive.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
